1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,155
第 2 部分从课上的循环开始
Part 2 starts with the lecture's loop.

2
00:00:02,475 --> 00:00:04,459
开发者把代码 commit 到代码库
Developers commit to the codebase.

3
00:00:04,779 --> 00:00:07,723
接着构建、测试：这是 CI 那一半
It is built and tested: that's the CI half.

4
00:00:08,043 --> 00:00:11,285
然后部署、监控：这是 CD 那一半
Then it is deployed and monitored: the CD half.

5
00:00:11,605 --> 00:00:14,080
每个阶段都会把通知发回来
Every stage sends notifications back.

6
00:00:14,317 --> 00:00:18,535
回顾部分的版本在测试和部署之间多加了一个方框
The version in the review adds one box between test and deploy:

7
00:00:18,535 --> 00:00:23,021
发布，也就是把测试过的版本交出去部署的那一刻
release, the moment a tested version is handed over for deployment.

8
00:00:23,267 --> 00:00:26,616
持续集成会在每次 push 时运行脚本
Continuous integration runs scripts on every push.

9
00:00:26,936 --> 00:00:29,575
很多开发者共享一个 repo
Many developers share one repository,

10
00:00:29,575 --> 00:00:35,211
每个改动都要通过自动化测试、编码规范和静态分析
and every change passes automated tests, coding standards, and static analysis,

11
00:00:35,211 --> 00:00:38,136
静态分析不用运行代码就能找出缺陷
which finds defects without running code.

12
00:00:38,456 --> 00:00:41,293
你在第 9 讲和第 21 讲里搭过它
You built this in lectures 9 and 21.

13
00:00:41,533 --> 00:00:43,389
然后是交付和部署
Then delivery and deployment.

14
00:00:43,709 --> 00:00:49,256
持续交付让每个改动都随时可以发布，但按下按钮的是一个人
Continuous delivery keeps every change ready to release, but a person presses the button.

15
00:00:49,576 --> 00:00:53,501
持续部署会自己把每个通过的改动上线
Continuous deployment ships every passing change by itself.

16
00:00:54,233 --> 00:00:55,633
对机器学习来说
For machine learning,

17
00:00:55,633 --> 00:01:00,484
CI 还要检查数据质量和模型性能，所以成本很高
CI also checks data quality and model performance, which makes it expensive.

18
00:01:00,804 --> 00:01:05,220
而 CD 只有在指标处于容差范围内时才发布模型
And CD releases a model only when its metrics are within a tolerance,

19
00:01:05,220 --> 00:01:07,140
还必须应对数据漂移
and must cope with data drift.

20
00:01:07,460 --> 00:01:11,961
这个 repo 部署的是应用，不是模型；模型是第 15 讲
This repo deploys an app, not a model; lecture 15 was the model.

21
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:13,821
现在把这个 repo 放到循环上
Now this repo on the loop.

22
00:01:14,141 --> 00:01:16,695
构建、发布和部署亮了起来
Build, release and deploy light up;

23
00:01:16,695 --> 00:01:20,051
发布就是带 tag 的 image 落进 ECR 的时候
release is when the tagged images land in ECR.

24
00:01:20,371 --> 00:01:21,871
测试这一格还是虚线
Test stays dashed:

25
00:01:21,871 --> 00:01:27,837
这个工作流叫持续集成和持续部署，却一个测试都不跑
the workflow is named continuous integration and continuous deployment, but runs no test.

26
00:01:28,157 --> 00:01:29,757
它是 CD 那一半
It's the CD half.

27
00:01:29,843 --> 00:01:33,725
而监控就是这次 run 的颜色，再加上你自己去网站上看一看
And monitor is the color of the run, plus your own check of the site.

28
00:01:33,967 --> 00:01:36,949
课上列了好几个 CI/CD 服务
The lecture names several CI/CD services;

29
00:01:36,949 --> 00:01:42,551
这门课用的是 GitHub Actions，构建部署 container 并运行它
the course uses GitHub Actions, to build the deployment container and run it,

30
00:01:42,551 --> 00:01:44,442
在每一个提出要求的 commit 上
on every commit that asks.

31
00:01:44,762 --> 00:01:49,689
工作流文件保持得很薄；部署逻辑就是你刚刚跑过的那些 playbook
The workflow file stays thin; the deploy logic is the playbooks you just ran.

32
00:01:51,133 --> 00:01:55,729
这个工作流文件 ci cd aws.yml 不在 README 里
The workflow file, ci_cd_aws.yml, isn't in the README,

33
00:01:55,729 --> 00:01:59,048
所以这个进度条上的每一步都是额外的
so every step on this tracker is extra.

34
00:01:59,368 --> 00:02:01,664
每次 push 到 main 它都会启动
It starts on every push to main,

35
00:02:01,664 --> 00:02:05,896
但这个 job 只在 commit 信息包含 /run- 时才运行
but the job runs only if the commit message contains /run-.

36
00:02:06,133 --> 00:02:09,281
而最后一步，Run Deployment Container
And the last step, Run Deployment Container,

37
00:02:09,281 --> 00:02:14,645
对同一条信息有它自己的条件：必须包含 /run-deploy-app
has its own condition on the same message: it must contain /run-deploy-app.

38
00:02:14,883 --> 00:02:16,504
两道筛子，一句话
Two sieves, one sentence.

39
00:02:16,824 --> 00:02:19,608
这条信息 update readme 里没有 /run-
The message update readme has no /run-,

40
00:02:19,608 --> 00:02:22,392
所以这个 job 被跳过，什么都不运行
so the job is skipped and nothing runs.

41
00:02:22,716 --> 00:02:27,153
轮到你了。你把 fix typo /run-tests push 到 main
Your turn. You push fix typo /run-tests to main.

42
00:02:27,473 --> 00:02:30,503
什么都不发生，只构建和 push，还是完整部署？
Nothing, build and push only, or a full deploy?

43
00:02:39,350 --> 00:02:40,921
只构建和 push
Build and push only.

44
00:02:40,971 --> 00:02:45,165
它通过了第一道筛子，所以 runner 构建三个新 image
It passes the first sieve, so the runner builds three new images

45
00:02:45,165 --> 00:02:48,310
再 push 到 ECR，在那里它们会产生存储费用
and pushes them to ECR, where they cost storage.

46
00:02:48,630 --> 00:02:52,214
它停在了第二道筛子，所以服务器还是用旧的 tag
It stops at the second sieve, so the server keeps the old tag.

47
00:02:52,450 --> 00:02:55,079
/run-deploy-app 两道筛子都能通过
/run-deploy-app passes both sieves:

48
00:02:55,079 --> 00:02:59,511
有新的 image，服务器上的 container 也会被重新创建
new images, and the containers on the server are recreated.

49
00:02:59,916 --> 00:03:01,559
那开头那个 commit 呢？
And the commit from the opening?

50
00:03:01,879 --> 00:03:03,479
它的斜杠是反斜杠
Its slash is a backslash.

51
00:03:03,799 --> 00:03:08,023
里面没有 /run- 这段文字，所以它在第一道筛子就被弹了回去
The text /run- isn't in it, so it bounces off the first sieve.

52
00:03:08,343 --> 00:03:09,943
这就是那一个字符
That's the one character.

53
00:03:10,050 --> 00:03:12,415
教程那一页课件说的也一样
The tutorial slide says the same:

54
00:03:12,415 --> 00:03:15,066
.github/workflows 里的一个工作流文件
a workflow file in .github/workflows,

55
00:03:15,066 --> 00:03:17,645
加上 commit 信息里的一个关键词
and a keyword in the commit message.

56
00:03:17,965 --> 00:03:22,295
它的关键词 /deploy-app 属于 Google Cloud 那个 repo
Its keyword, /deploy-app, belongs to the Google Cloud repo.

57
00:03:22,615 --> 00:03:24,428
这里是 /run-deploy-app
Here it's /run-deploy-app.

58
00:03:26,966 --> 00:03:30,050
所谓 head commit，指的是一次 push 里的最后一个 commit
head_commit means the last commit of a push,

59
00:03:30,050 --> 00:03:33,025
所以三个 commit 只按最后一条信息来判断
so three commits are judged by the last message only.

60
00:03:33,345 --> 00:03:34,966
而且匹配不区分大小写
And the match ignores case.

61
00:03:36,117 --> 00:03:39,104
第 2 部分需要你自己的 GitHub repo
Part 2 needs your own GitHub repository.

62
00:03:39,424 --> 00:03:41,729
暂停一下，建一个空的私有 repo
Pause, create an empty private one,

63
00:03:41,729 --> 00:03:43,968
把 origin 指向它，再 push main
point origin at it, and push main.

64
00:03:44,288 --> 00:03:48,298
它最后一条信息里没有 /run-，所以暂时什么都不会运行
Its last message has no /run-, so nothing runs yet.

65
00:03:48,534 --> 00:03:52,195
先把你的 secret 交给 GitHub：在你的 repo 里
First, give GitHub your secrets: in your repository,

66
00:03:52,195 --> 00:03:55,083
打开 Settings，Secrets and variables，Actions
Settings, Secrets and variables, Actions.

67
00:03:55,403 --> 00:04:00,541
加四个：访问密钥 ID、私有访问密钥、你的账号 ID
Add four: the access key ID, the secret key, your account ID,

68
00:04:00,541 --> 00:04:03,574
还有 AWS SSH key，也就是整个 pem 文件
and AWS_SSH_KEY, the whole pem file.

69
00:04:03,894 --> 00:04:05,622
这些名字来自工作流文件
The names come from the workflow.

70
00:04:05,867 --> 00:04:07,933
你的徽章现在有了第三份副本
Your badge has a third copy now,

71
00:04:07,933 --> 00:04:10,774
在 GitHub 上的保险库里，你的钥匙也有了第二份
in a vault on GitHub, and your key a second.

72
00:04:11,094 --> 00:04:13,611
每多一份副本，就多一个要保护的地方
Every copy is one more place to protect.

73
00:04:13,850 --> 00:04:16,175
这个 runner 是一台全新的 Ubuntu 机器
The runner is a fresh Ubuntu machine.

74
00:04:16,495 --> 00:04:21,018
一个来自 AWS 的 action，用两个 secret 配好它的凭据
An action from AWS sets up its credentials from two secrets.

75
00:04:21,338 --> 00:04:24,066
然后它检查自己的身份，列出 S3
Then it checks who it is, lists S3,

76
00:04:24,066 --> 00:04:27,184
再让 Docker 登录你的 ECR registry
and logs Docker in to your ECR registry.

77
00:04:27,434 --> 00:04:31,167
然后它用 commit 进去的 Dockerfile 构建同一个工具箱容器
Then it builds the same toolbox, from the committed Dockerfile.

78
00:04:31,487 --> 00:04:34,623
所以第 1 部分对 Helm 的修复，要放进你的 commit 里
So the Helm fix from part 1 belongs in your commit.

79
00:04:34,943 --> 00:04:38,506
我们没测试过：runner 会不会遇到同样的证书错误
We didn't test whether runners hit the same certificate error.

80
00:04:38,750 --> 00:04:42,600
接下来，用日期生成一个新的 tag，写进 .docker-tag
Next, a fresh tag from the date, written to .docker-tag

81
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:45,470
也写进一个 GitHub 在步骤之间保留的文件
and to a file GitHub keeps between steps.

82
00:04:45,790 --> 00:04:48,073
手动跑一下，它给出的是一个时间戳
Run by hand, it gives a timestamp.

83
00:04:48,684 --> 00:04:53,045
然后前端用普通的 docker build、docker tag 和 docker push
Then plain docker build, docker tag and docker push for the frontend,

84
00:04:53,045 --> 00:04:55,447
另外两个 image 也一样
and the same for the other two images.

85
00:04:55,767 --> 00:04:59,628
在 CI 里，构建应用 image 的是 runner，不是 playbook
In CI, the runner builds the app images, not the playbook.

86
00:04:59,867 --> 00:05:01,787
所以工具箱容器只负责部署
So the toolbox only deploys.

87
00:05:02,107 --> 00:05:05,584
和你的笔记本相比：同一个工具箱容器，同一个 socket
Compared with your laptop: same toolbox, same socket.

88
00:05:05,904 --> 00:05:09,972
但 deployment 目录在 /deployment
But the deployment folder sits at /deployment,

89
00:05:09,972 --> 00:05:13,776
密钥在 /root/.ssh，也没有应用目录
the keys at /root/.ssh, and no app folders.

90
00:05:15,617 --> 00:05:17,345
最后是 SSH 密钥
Last, the SSH key.

91
00:05:17,665 --> 00:05:21,235
这一步写出一份 SSH 配置
The step writes an SSH config,

92
00:05:21,235 --> 00:05:26,710
把你的密钥写成 ac215_2024.pem，权限 600
and your key as ac215_2024.pem, with mode 600.

93
00:05:27,030 --> 00:05:29,626
它把两个文件都拷进 deployment 目录
It copies both into the deployment folder,

94
00:05:29,626 --> 00:05:31,852
只在 runner 上，从不 commit
on the runner only, never committed.

95
00:05:36,133 --> 00:05:39,273
部署这一步在 runner 上运行工具箱容器
The deploy step runs the toolbox on the runner,

96
00:05:39,273 --> 00:05:43,316
带上 socket、两个目录和五个环境变量
with the socket, two folders, and five environment variables,

97
00:05:43,316 --> 00:05:44,916
其中就有 Docker tag 变量
DOCKER_TAG among them.

98
00:05:45,050 --> 00:05:49,531
里面是一长串命令：修好权限，登录 ECR
Inside, one long command: fix permissions, log in to ECR,

99
00:05:49,531 --> 00:05:53,068
用新 tag 运行 deploy-setup-containers
run deploy-setup-containers with the new tag,

100
00:05:53,068 --> 00:05:55,269
再运行 deploy-setup-webserver
then deploy-setup-webserver.

101
00:05:55,589 --> 00:05:58,660
每一环只有在前一环成功时才运行
Each link runs only if the one before succeeded.

102
00:05:58,900 --> 00:06:03,328
手动跑一下，作为额外步骤，它打印出 tag，列出密钥
Run by hand, as an extra, it prints the tag and lists the key,

103
00:06:03,328 --> 00:06:07,113
然后在 ECR 登录这一步，因为我们的占位密钥停了下来
then stops at the ECR login with our placeholder key.

104
00:06:07,433 --> 00:06:09,033
两个 playbook 都没有运行
Neither playbook runs.

105
00:06:10,366 --> 00:06:11,916
跟着一个 tag 走
Follow one tag.

106
00:06:11,966 --> 00:06:13,789
日期在 runner 上给它盖上时间戳
The date stamps it on the runner.

107
00:06:13,993 --> 00:06:16,520
它作为 extra vars 进入 Ansible
It reaches Ansible as an extra variable,

108
00:06:16,520 --> 00:06:18,983
优先级高于 playbook 里设的任何值
which beats anything the playbook sets,

109
00:06:18,983 --> 00:06:22,078
所以服务器会按这个 tag pull 那三个 image
so the server pulls the three images at that tag.

110
00:06:22,316 --> 00:06:24,421
然后每个 container 都被重新创建
Then each container is recreated:

111
00:06:24,421 --> 00:06:28,503
旧的停掉，新的启动，中间有一小段空档
the old one stops, the new one starts, with a short gap between.

112
00:06:28,750 --> 00:06:33,805
课件部署到一个 Kubernetes 集群上，在那里，和第 22 讲一样
The slides deploy to a Kubernetes cluster, where, as in lecture 22,

113
00:06:33,805 --> 00:06:38,030
滚动更新会先启动新的 Pod，再让旧的离开
a rolling update starts new pods before the old ones go.

114
00:06:38,350 --> 00:06:41,059
一台机器只能直接替换；它滚动不起来
One machine can only swap; it doesn't roll.

115
00:06:41,300 --> 00:06:42,786
要 commit 四样东西
Commit four things.

116
00:06:42,836 --> 00:06:44,934
你服务器的地址，填在第 30 行
Your server address on line 30:

117
00:06:44,934 --> 00:06:47,167
CI 部署的是 commit 进去的任何东西
CI deploys whatever is committed.

118
00:06:47,487 --> 00:06:50,964
撤销第 9 步：打开第 4 行，关掉第 7 行
Step 9 undone: line 4 on, line 7 off.

119
00:06:51,284 --> 00:06:52,706
Helm 的修复
The Helm fix.

120
00:06:52,756 --> 00:06:54,093
Chroma 的 pin
The Chroma pin.

121
00:06:54,143 --> 00:06:58,437
git add . 也会 commit 你的账号 ID 和 NextAuth secret
git add . also commits your account ID and NEXTAUTH_SECRET,

122
00:06:58,437 --> 00:07:00,692
所以 repo 要保持私有
so keep the repository private.

123
00:07:00,933 --> 00:07:05,307
然后是课件上的三条命令，换上这个 repo 的关键词：git add .
Then the slide's three commands, with this repo's keyword: git add .,

124
00:07:05,307 --> 00:07:09,616
git commit -m 的信息里写上 /run-deploy-app，再 git push
git commit -m "…" with /run-deploy-app in the message, and git push.

125
00:07:09,936 --> 00:07:11,536
暂停一下，push
Pause, and push.

126
00:07:16,516 --> 00:07:20,051
一次绿色的 run，意思是每个跑过的步骤都以 0 退出
A green run means every step that ran exited with zero,

127
00:07:20,051 --> 00:07:21,651
并不代表应用能用
not that the app works.

128
00:07:21,849 --> 00:07:25,946
重新加载你的网站，再到服务器的 image 那一列里找新的 tag
Reload your site, and find the new tag in the server's image column.

129
00:07:26,183 --> 00:07:27,790
用课上的话说
In the lecture's words:

130
00:07:27,790 --> 00:07:32,818
敲 /run-deploy-app 算持续交付，还是持续部署？
is typing /run-deploy-app continuous delivery, or continuous deployment?

131
00:07:33,138 --> 00:07:34,738
怎样才能让它变成另一个？
What would make it the other?

132
00:07:45,450 --> 00:07:46,637
持续交付
Delivery.

133
00:07:46,687 --> 00:07:51,743
每次发布都由一个人敲关键词来决定，而且之前什么都没测试
A person decides each release by typing the keyword, and nothing is tested first.

134
00:07:52,063 --> 00:07:53,974
把每次合并到 main 都部署出去
Deploy every merge to main,

135
00:07:53,974 --> 00:07:58,997
前面挡着第 21 讲的测试，它就变成了持续部署
behind the tests from lecture 21, and it becomes continuous deployment.

136
00:07:59,317 --> 00:08:00,917
这就是 Milestone 5
That is Milestone 5.

137
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:05,008
回到 README，看它的最后一步：删除
Back to the README, for its last step: delete.

138
00:08:05,328 --> 00:08:09,019
它跑的还是同一个 playbook，cluster state 设为 absent
It runs the same playbook with cluster_state=absent.

139
00:08:09,339 --> 00:08:10,939
看看那些 when 行
Look at the when: lines.

140
00:08:11,003 --> 00:08:12,709
这三个 task 里，哪些会运行？
Which of these three tasks run?

141
00:08:21,550 --> 00:08:23,214
完全照着写的来跑
Run it exactly as written.

142
00:08:23,534 --> 00:08:25,155
安全组，skipping
Security group, skipping.

143
00:08:25,475 --> 00:08:27,353
EBS volume，skipping
EBS volume, skipping.

144
00:08:27,673 --> 00:08:30,510
然后实例那个 task 没有 when 行
Then the instance task has no when: line,

145
00:08:30,510 --> 00:08:32,793
结果失败了：no attribute group ID
and fails: no attribute group_id.

146
00:08:33,113 --> 00:08:35,481
这发生在任何 AWS 调用之前
That is before any AWS call.

147
00:08:35,717 --> 00:08:38,407
被跳过的 task 从来没有设好安全组
The skipped task never set the security group,

148
00:08:38,407 --> 00:08:40,453
所以实例那个 task 被它绊倒了
so the instance task trips over it.

149
00:08:40,773 --> 00:08:42,002
就算过了这一关
Even past that,

150
00:08:42,002 --> 00:08:46,568
删除还需要一个只有创建时才会 register 的 volume ID
the removal needs a volume ID that only a create run registers,

151
00:08:46,568 --> 00:08:49,242
而且没有任何 task 去终止实例
and no task terminates the instance.

152
00:08:49,562 --> 00:08:51,162
所以要手动清理
So clean up by hand.

153
00:08:51,250 --> 00:08:56,930
在 EC2 控制台里，终止实例，然后删除那个 50 GB 的 volume
In the EC2 console, terminate the instance, then delete the 50 gigabyte volume,

154
00:08:56,930 --> 00:09:00,957
实例没了它还在，再删掉安全组和你的密钥对
which outlives it, the security group and your key pair.

155
00:09:01,277 --> 00:09:04,377
成本是课上说的 CD 的挑战之一
Cost is one of the lecture's challenges for CD,

156
